====Ice spells====
'''[[Ice spells]]''' are one of four types of [[Ancient Magicks]] combat spells, and the only type that can apply Freeze. Ice spells are notable for high damage and Area of Effect capability, giving players the ability to freeze multiple targets at the same time.

Upon being affected by an ice spell the chat box will report: {{Mes|You have been frozen!|color=red}}

When the effect is about to expire the following message notifies the affected player: {{Mes|The freeze cast upon you is beginning to thaw.|color=red}}

[[Blighted ancient ice sack|Blighted ancient ice sacks]] allow players to cast these spells in lieu of using runes while in the [[Wilderness]], [[PvP worlds]], [[Castle Wars]], [[Clan Wars]], or [[Soul Wars]]. Keep in mind switching weapons '''will cancel''' auto-casting when in the Wilderness.

